Package: xtx.api
Title: Cross-Modal Generative Interfaces
Version: 0.1.0.14
Date: 2026-09-15
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: A unified interface for cross-modal generative models: text to
    image, image to video, text to video, and speech-driven talking heads.
    The package is a lightweight orchestration layer over external generation
    engines, either in-process through the 'diffuseR' package or over HTTP to
    self-hosted services such as 'WanGP' <https://github.com/deepbeepmeep/Wan2GP>
    and 'SadTalker' <https://github.com/OpenTalker/SadTalker>, and to hosted
    services such as 'OpenAI' <https://openai.com/>. Every asset-producing
    call records a sidecar file describing the request and the delivered
    media. Designed to pair with the 'stt.api' and 'tts.api' packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
SystemRequirements: ffmpeg and ffprobe on the PATH for the in-process video
    backends and for media probing of delivered files.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
